B.aCI=s(["Hey, are you cheating? That\u2019s right!","Nice! I thought you were slower.","Correct. Don\u2019t get a big head."],t.s)
B.aCe=s(["Oops! I\u2019ll keep that to myself.","Missed! I\u2019ve seen worse\u2026 me, for instance.","Ha! Almost. Almost."],t.s)
