B.auH=s(["Gorgeous! That sounds right!","Bravo! It sounds like a song.","Perfect, perfect, perfect!"],t.s)
B.aHU=s(["Wrong note! Never mind, again.","Oops! Even stars rehearse.","Missed, but with style!"],t.s)
